      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "4 BEDROOM DETACHED HOUSE ON C.0.7 ACRES\r\n\r\nKillian Lynch Auctioneers are pleased to offer this beautiful 4 bedroom detached house on c.0.7 acres. The property which extends to c.2000 sq.ft. living accommodation is in excellent condition throughout and comes with panoramic views over the surrounding countryside. \r\nLocated in a private setting, c.15 minutes drive from Macroom town, c.5 minutes from Tarelton village and c.40 minutes from Cork City.\r\n\r\nServices:\r\nPrivate water & drainage, oil fired central heating, ESB"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Porch - 1.8m x 1.4m \r\nTiled flooring\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall - 5.1m x 2.0m \r\nWooden flooring, recess spot lighting\r\n\r\nLiving room - 4.2m x 3.8m \r\nWooden flooring, open fire with wooden surround, door to sun room\r\n\r\nSun room - 4.0m x 3.2m \r\nTiled flooring, french doors to side gardens\r\n\r\nKitchen/dining room - 6.9m x 4.2m \r\nTiled flooring, fited kitchen, worktop, sink, tiled splashback, integrated Hotpoint hob, extractor fan, integrated Bosch double oven, integrated NEFF washing machine, recess spot lighting\r\n\r\nUtility room - 4.4m x 2.4m \r\nTiled flooring, door to rear gardens \r\n\r\nJack & Jill Bathroom/Ensuite - 2.5m x 1.9m \r\nTiled throughout, W.C., W.H.B., electric shower\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.2m x 3.0m \r\nWooden flooring\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR - \r\n\r\n\r\nLanding - 6.9m x 2.1m \r\nCarpet flooring, recess spot lighting \r\n\r\nHotpress/storage - 2.5m x 1.5m \r\nWooden flooring\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.7m x 2.4m \r\nTiled throughout, W.C., W.H.B., bath\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 4.2m x 3.1m \r\nWooden flooring\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 4.3m x 3.7m \r\nWooden flooring\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom (4) - 4.2m x 4.1m \r\nCarpet flooring\r\n\r\nWalk in wardrobe - 2.5m x 1.5m \r\nWooden flooring\r\n\r\nEnsuite - 2.6m x 2.4m \r\nTiled flooring, W.C., W.H.B., power shower\r\n\r\n"
